<p>Enters stealth mode (power <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">38, 48, 55, 60, 64,</acronym> based on Cunning), making you harder to detect.</p><p>If successful (re-checked each turn), enemies will not know exactly where you are, or may not notice you at all.</p><p>Stealth reduces your light radius to 0, increases your infravision by 3, and will not work with heavy or massive armours.</p><p>You cannot enter stealth if there are foes in sight within range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 8, 7, 6, 5.</acronym></p><p>Any non-instant, non-movement action will break stealth if not otherwise specified.</p><p></p><p>Enemies uncertain of your location will still make educated guesses at it.</p><p>While stealthed, enemies cannot share information about your location with each other and will be delayed in telling their allies that you exist at all.</p>